  <item>
    <title>010.【粤语】你也是个常常怀旧的人吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b46bf85faf36865955bc69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b46bf85faf36865955bc69</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Aug 2025 16:08:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听、收看我们的第十期芝游淡定。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间过得真快啊，2025年马上正式步入秋天了。每年一到秋季，就感觉节日气氛愈发浓厚。尤其是在各大媒体平台，已经可以看到中秋乃至圣诞的节日元素。除了那些对节日的期待，更多的还有对旧时节日氛围的怀旧情愫。借助AI的力量，似乎越来越多的旧日景象得以“重现”眼前。每次看到那些旧时光的印迹，都会深受触动，这一期，就让我和Momo一起聊聊我们俩的怀旧情感吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 话题引入、对怀旧一词的理解</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="317">05:17</a> 个人怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 集体怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="661">11:01</a> &nbsp;人际怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> &nbsp;地方怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> &nbsp;文化怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 审美怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1958">32:38</a> 游游和Momo的“番煲”怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">41:03</a> 相簿怀旧--人生小糖丸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 物之哀文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2773">46:13</a> 食物怀旧--游游的童年回忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3235">53:55</a> 烟花绚烂--Momo的场景式怀旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">56:38</a> 游游怀旧的情感根源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3845">64:05</a> 大众怀旧现象--AI再现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3980">66:20</a> 你会坐上时空穿梭机吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4382">73:02</a> 怀旧现象小迷思</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>"滋油淡定"，在广东话中是指悠然自在，不紧不慢的状态。希望观看这个频道的你，也能找到滋油淡定的节奏。Chill啲lar！</span></p><span></span><p><span>**各位听众朋友，请不要对Momo的发音太苛刻哦，请当一个养成系播客欣赏，谢谢！**片头片尾乐：Just like the Sun/作者:Bonkers Beat Club/来源：Epidemic Sound</span></p>]]></description>
