    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687f9d7fa9dec92500a1d6a4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687f9d7fa9dec92500a1d6a4</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听、收看我们的第九期芝游淡定。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家对于朋友的终级想象是怎样的呢？如今你们已经寻到挚友了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这期播客中，我和Momo会一起聊聊各自的交友经历，谈谈我们与AI、与朋友的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 与人工智能“交友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 密友曾经于Momo的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="536">08:56</a> 游游的0密友舒适圈（无压力交往/明确界限感/深埋的内心）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 比起密友，“忽远忽近”的友人带给我们更大的满足感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a> 不敢直面冲突的朋友，或许不算真正的密友。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 我们与朋友或许不同步的准则（游游的主动推动/打破僵局）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2382">39:42</a> Momo的“创伤”友谊经历、预断难断式友谊往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2742">45:42</a>游游的中学往事</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>"滋油淡定"，在广东话中是指悠然自在，不紧不慢的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望观看这个频道的你，也能找到滋油淡定的节奏。Chill啲lar！</span></p><span></span><p><span>**各位听众朋友，请不要对Momo的发音太苛刻哦，请当一个养成系播客欣赏，谢谢！**</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头片尾乐：Just like the Sun/作者:Bonkers Beat Club/来源：Epidemic Sound</span></p>]]></description>
