  <item>
    <title>003.【粤语】听说过“心灵战栗”吗？那些深受触动的瞬间，塑造了今日的你我</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/676d4db91e823e72d30145ee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">676d4db91e823e72d30145ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Dec 2024 12:47:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一期开场就想爆哭。回溯那些与“美”产生共鸣的时刻，依旧记得当时灵魂的撼动。观看节目的大家，你们有与我和Momo相似的“心灵战栗”吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许你们也有自己独一无二的经历，可以分享在评论区告诉我们哦！2025年即将到来，祝各位都能有更美好的新一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 本集介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 心灵战栗是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> MJ给游游的心灵战栗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> 关于《丹麦女孩》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="985">16:25</a> 心灵战栗也可以是平静的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> 体验不同类型的心灵战栗，我们重新认识自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2554">42:34</a> 艺术、审美于我们的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3373">56:13</a> 心灵战栗，是感性人的专属吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3625">60:25</a> 感受心灵战栗需要的只是契机</span></p><span></span><p><span>各位听众朋友，请不要对Momo的发音太苛刻哦，请当一个养成系播客欣赏，谢谢！片头片尾乐：Just like the Sun/作者:Bonkers Beat Club/来源：Epidemic Sound</span></p>]]></description>
