    <title>001.【粤语】第一期就谈谈自己，谈谈身份焦虑吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67013bdf81cdab3a93ead275</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67013bdf81cdab3a93ead275</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Oct 2024 13:15:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我和Momo的第一期播客终于！上线了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期播客耗费了我们许多精力，由于是初尝试，我们的音频录制出了岔子，所以如果有对音质要求高的听众，请不要太早退出，本次只是意外！而且内容绝对精彩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 我们播客的名字由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 我们奇妙的结缘经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a>在异国他乡，Momo的身份焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a>peer pressure（同龄人焦虑）的解药到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1133">18:53</a>做一个不焦虑的妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a>自省很好，“但我面对不了犯错的自己”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a>主体化？客体化？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2113">35:13</a>焦虑与执着的背后，是我们想要模仿他人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期Momo提及书籍"Wanting:The Power of Mimetic Desire in Everyday Life"</span></p><span></span><p><span>各位听众朋友，请不要对Momo的发音太苛刻哦，请当一个养成系播客欣赏，谢谢！</span></p>]]></description>
